   任何人在本地配置的密钥都由其自行保管，不属于本仓库内容。

   Credentials and user data — this repository contains NO API keys, access
   tokens, session data or conversation memory. `.gitignore` explicitly
   excludes `.credentials.yaml`, `.env`, `standalone-ai.json`, `memory.json`
